(1592,291,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"beb4d8e\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"bd4a7eb\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<div class=\\\"iac-lab\\\">\\r\\n\\r\\n<p class=\\\"iac-subtitle\\\">\\r\\nProyecto de Infraestructura como C\\u00f3digo (IaC) que implementa la gesti\\u00f3n integral de un entorno virtualizado sobre Proxmox, utilizando Terraform para el aprovisionamiento de la infraestructura y Ansible para la automatizaci\\u00f3n de la configuraci\\u00f3n.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<div class=\\\"iac-card\\\">\\r\\n<h3>Descripci\\u00f3n<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>Este proyecto implementa la infraestructura tecnol\\u00f3gica completa de una inmobiliaria, integrando todos los bloques de un entorno de producci\\u00f3n real:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Infraestructura completa desde cero<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Red segmentada por VLANs<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Virtualizaci\\u00f3n en Proxmox<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Despliegue automatizado: Terraform + Ansible<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>WordPress + MariaDB en Docker<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Monitorizaci\\u00f3n con Zabbix<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Acceso seguro con Tailscale<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Arquitectura<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>El acceso administrativo remoto se realiza a trav\\u00e9s de <b>Tailscale<\\/b>, sin exponer ning\\u00fan puerto cr\\u00edtico a internet.<\\/p>\\r\\n<pre>\\r\\nInternet\\r\\n    \\u2502\\r\\n    \\u25bc\\r\\nOPNsense (VM 201) \\u2014 Firewall \\u00b7 DHCP \\u00b7 VLANs \\u00b7 NAT\\r\\n    \\u2502\\r\\n    \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 VLAN 10 \\u2014 Management (10.0.10.0\\/24)\\r\\n    \\u2502       \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 VM 200 \\u00b7 Central-Node   10.0.10.200\\r\\n    \\u2502\\r\\n    \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 VLAN 20 \\u2014 Servers (10.0.20.0\\/24)\\r\\n    \\u2502       \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 VM 202 \\u00b7 Zabbix  10.0.20.202\\r\\n    \\u2502\\r\\n    \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 VLAN 30 \\u2014 DMZ (10.0.30.0\\/24)\\r\\n    \\u2502       \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 VM 203 \\u00b7 WordPress         10.0.30.203\\r\\n    \\u2502\\r\\n    \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 VLAN 40 \\u2014 Database (10.0.40.0\\/24)\\r\\n            \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 VM 204 \\u00b7 MariaDB           10.0.40.204\\r\\n<\\/pre>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Stack tecnol\\u00f3gico<\\/h3>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n    <table class=\\\"iac-stack-table\\\">\\r\\n  <thead>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <th>Categor\\u00eda<\\/th>\\r\\n      <th>Tecnolog\\u00eda<\\/th>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <\\/thead>\\r\\n  <tbody>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>Hipervisor<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>Proxmox VE<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>IaC \\u2014 Aprovisionamiento<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>Terraform (bpg\\/proxmox provider)<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>IaC \\u2014 Configuraci\\u00f3n<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>Ansible<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>Firewall \\/ Red<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>OPNsense \\u00b7 VLANs 802.1Q<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>Web<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>WordPress + Apache \\u00b7 Docker Compose<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>Base de datos<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>MariaDB 10.11<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>SSL<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>Let\'s Encrypt<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>Monitorizaci\\u00f3n<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>Zabbix 7.0<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>Acceso remoto<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>Tailscale (WireGuard)<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>DNS din\\u00e1mico<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>Dinahosting<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>Backup<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>Proxmox Backup + estrategia 3-2-1<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <\\/tbody>\\r\\n<\\/table>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Despliegue<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>1. Clonar repositorio<\\/h3>\\r\\n<pre>git clone --recurse-submodules https:\\/\\/github.com\\/<usuario>\\/iac-deployment-lab.git\\r\\ncd iac-deployment-lab<\\/pre>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>2. Configurar Terraform<\\/h3>\\r\\n<pre>\\r\\ncd terraform\\r\\nexport TF_VAR_pm_password=\\\"tu_contrase\\u00f1a_proxmox\\\"\\r\\nterraform init\\r\\nterraform plan\\r\\nterraform apply\\r\\n<\\/pre>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>3. Ejecutar playbook de Ansible<\\/h3>\\r\\n<pre>\\r\\nansible-playbook -i inventory.ini playbook.yml\\r\\n<\\/pre>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Seguridad<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>La seguridad se implementa mediante defensa en profundidad: m\\u00faltiples capas independientes.<\\/p>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"iac-card\\\">\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Firewall OPNsense<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Segmentaci\\u00f3n VLAN<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Acceso con Tailscale<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>SSL con Let\'s Encrypt<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Backups 3-2-1<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Monitorizaci\\u00f3n<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>Zabbix monitoriza los siguientes hosts y m\\u00e9tricas clave:<\\/p>\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tr><th>Host<\\/th><th>IP<\\/th><th>M\\u00e9tricas<\\/th><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>Proxmox<\\/td><td>192.168.1.220<\\/td><td>CPU, RAM<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>WordPress<\\/td><td>10.0.30.204<\\/td><td>HTTP, rendimiento<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>MariaDB<\\/td><td>10.0.40.205<\\/td><td>Queries, conexiones<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/table>\\r\\n<p>Alertas configuradas con env\\u00edo por email para: disco > 80%, servicios ca\\u00eddos, CPU sostenida > 85%, y timeout HTTP.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/div>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
