(2464,473,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"07c31aa\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path_hover\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"f03bcff\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<div style=\\\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6;\\\">\\r\\n\\r\\n  <h2>Diagrama de Gantt<\\/h2>\\r\\n  <p><strong>Periodo total:<\\/strong> 02 de marzo \\u2192 05 de junio (\\u2248 14 semanas)<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n  <p>\\r\\n    La distribuci\\u00f3n de tareas del proyecto se ha definido teniendo en cuenta el perfil de cada integrante, \\r\\n    aunque con coordinaci\\u00f3n continua en los puntos en los que las distintas partes se solapan.\\r\\n  <\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n  <h3>Iria \\u2014 Redes, seguridad y frontend<\\/h3>\\r\\n  <ul>\\r\\n    <li>Configuraci\\u00f3n del entorno en Proxmox VE<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Configuraci\\u00f3n del firewall con OPNsense (reglas y segmentaci\\u00f3n)<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Servicios base: DNS y DHCP<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Acceso remoto seguro con Tailscale<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Sistema de detecci\\u00f3n de intrusiones con CrowdSec<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Configuraci\\u00f3n de Traefik como proxy inverso con certificados SSL (Let\'s Encrypt)<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Desarrollo del frontend en WordPress (tema, contenidos y ajustes)<\\/li>\\r\\n  <\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n  <h3>Josean\\u00eda \\u2014 Automatizaci\\u00f3n, infraestructura y backend<\\/h3>\\r\\n  <ul>\\r\\n    <li>Infraestructura como c\\u00f3digo con Terraform (creaci\\u00f3n de VMs)<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Automatizaci\\u00f3n con playbooks de Ansible<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Gesti\\u00f3n de credenciales con TeamPass<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Despliegue del stack con Docker Compose<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Backend de base de datos con MariaDB<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Definici\\u00f3n de la estrategia de copias de seguridad (3-2-1)<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Monitorizaci\\u00f3n con Zabbix (m\\u00e9tricas y alertas)<\\/li>\\r\\n  <\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n  <h3>Trabajo conjunto<\\/h3>\\r\\n  <ul>\\r\\n    <li>Planificaci\\u00f3n general del proyecto<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Dise\\u00f1o de la arquitectura de red (VLANs)<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Pruebas de integraci\\u00f3n entre sistemas<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Documentaci\\u00f3n final (memoria y blog)<\\/li>\\r\\n  <\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n  <p>\\r\\n    De esta forma, aunque cada una tiene un \\u00e1rea principal bien definida, el proyecto se est\\u00e1 \\r\\n    desarrollando de manera coordinada para asegurar que todas las piezas encajen correctamente.\\r\\n  <\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n  <h3>Fases del proyecto<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n  <!-- TABLA -->\\r\\n  <table border=\\\"1\\\" cellpadding=\\\"8\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\\\">\\r\\n    <thead style=\\\"background-color: #f2f2f2;\\\">\\r\\n      <tr>\\r\\n        <th>Fase<\\/th>\\r\\n        <th>Fechas<\\/th>\\r\\n        <th>Duraci\\u00f3n<\\/th>\\r\\n        <th>Responsable(s)<\\/th>\\r\\n        <th>Descripci\\u00f3n<\\/th>\\r\\n      <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <\\/thead>\\r\\n    <tbody>\\r\\n      <tr>\\r\\n        <td>1. Planificaci\\u00f3n y an\\u00e1lisis<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>02 mar \\u2013 10 mar<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>1 semana<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Iria + Joseania<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Definici\\u00f3n de objetivos y arquitectura inicial<\\/td>\\r\\n      <\\/tr>\\r\\n      <tr>\\r\\n        <td rowspan=\\\"2\\\">2. Dise\\u00f1o de arquitectura<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>11 mar \\u2013 20 mar<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>1,5 semanas<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Iria<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Dise\\u00f1o de red<\\/td>\\r\\n      <\\/tr>\\r\\n      <tr>\\r\\n        <td>11 mar \\u2013 20 mar<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>1,5 semanas<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Joseania<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Dise\\u00f1o de infraestructura<\\/td>\\r\\n      <\\/tr>\\r\\n      <tr>\\r\\n        <td>3. Hardware y virtualizaci\\u00f3n<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>21 mar \\u2013 30 mar<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>1,5 semanas<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Iria<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Instalaci\\u00f3n de Proxmox<\\/td>\\r\\n      <\\/tr>\\r\\n      <tr>\\r\\n        <td>4. Red, conectividad y servicios base<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>25 mar \\u2013 10 abr<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>2 semanas<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Iria<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Firewall, VLANs y DNS<\\/td>\\r\\n      <\\/tr>\\r\\n      <tr>\\r\\n        <td>5. Base de datos<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>08 abr \\u2013 15 abr<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>1 semana<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Joseania<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>MariaDB<\\/td>\\r\\n      <\\/tr>\\r\\n      <tr>\\r\\n        <td>6. Despliegue web<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>12 abr \\u2013 22 abr<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>1,5 semanas<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Iria + Josean\\u00eda<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>WordPress y Docker<\\/td>\\r\\n      <\\/tr>\\r\\n      <tr>\\r\\n        <td>7. Automatizaci\\u00f3n<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>15 abr \\u2013 30 abr<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>2 semanas<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Josean\\u00eda<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Terraform y Ansible<\\/td>\\r\\n      <\\/tr>\\r\\n      <tr>\\r\\n        <td>8. Seguridad<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>20 abr \\u2013 05 may<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>2 semanas<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Iria<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Seguridad completa<\\/td>\\r\\n      <\\/tr>\\r\\n      <tr>\\r\\n        <td>9. Monitorizaci\\u00f3n<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>01 may \\u2013 10 may<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>1,5 semanas<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Josean\\u00eda<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Zabbix<\\/td>\\r\\n      <\\/tr>\\r\\n      <tr>\\r\\n        <td>10. Pruebas<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>10 may \\u2013 20 may<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>1,5 semanas<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Ambas<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Testing<\\/td>\\r\\n      <\\/tr>\\r\\n      <tr>\\r\\n        <td>11. Documentaci\\u00f3n<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>02 mar \\u2013 02 jun<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>3 meses (Ongoing)<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Ambas<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Memoria y blog<\\/td>\\r\\n      <\\/tr>\\r\\n      <tr>\\r\\n        <td>12. Listo para entrega final<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>03 jun \\u2013 05 jun<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>3 d\\u00edas<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Ambas<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Entrega<\\/td>\\r\\n      <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <\\/tbody>\\r\\n  <\\/table>\",\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path_hover\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
