(2668,532,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"7318219\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path_hover\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"9dfb24f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\r\\n<html lang=\\\"es\\\">\\r\\n<head>\\r\\n<meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\">\\r\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\">\\r\\n<title>Mis contribuciones al proyecto<\\/title>\\r\\n<style>\\r\\n  \\/* Paleta de colores inspirada en el logotipo y el prompt *\\/\\r\\n  :root {\\r\\n    --primary-blue: #0277bd; \\/* Azul medio\\/oscuro para t\\u00edtulos principales *\\/\\r\\n    --accent-light-blue: #4fc3f7; \\/* Azul claro solicitado, mismo tono que el logotipo *\\/\\r\\n    --text-dark: #212121; \\/* Texto oscuro principal *\\/\\r\\n    --text-medium: #616161; \\/* Texto secundario gris *\\/\\r\\n    --bg-light: #f5f5f5; \\/* Fondo gris claro *\\/\\r\\n    --card-bg: #ffffff; \\/* Fondo blanco para tarjetas *\\/\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  body {\\r\\n    font-family: \'Segoe UI\', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;\\r\\n    background-color: var(--bg-light);\\r\\n    color: var(--text-dark);\\r\\n    margin: 0;\\r\\n    padding: 20px;\\r\\n    display: flex;\\r\\n    justify-content: center;\\r\\n    align-items: flex-start;\\r\\n    min-height: 100vh;\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  .container {\\r\\n    max-width: 800px;\\r\\n    background-color: var(--card-bg);\\r\\n    padding: 30px;\\r\\n    border-radius: 12px;\\r\\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  .logo-wrapper {\\r\\n    display: flex;\\r\\n    justify-content: center;\\r\\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  .logo-placeholder {\\r\\n    width: 150px;\\r\\n    height: 100px;\\r\\n    border: 2px dashed var(--accent-light-blue);\\r\\n    border-radius: 8px;\\r\\n    display: flex;\\r\\n    justify-content: center;\\r\\n    align-items: center;\\r\\n    color: var(--text-medium);\\r\\n    font-size: 0.9em;\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  .main-title {\\r\\n    font-size: 2.5em;\\r\\n    color: var(--primary-blue);\\r\\n    text-align: center;\\r\\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\\r\\n    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--accent-light-blue);\\r\\n    padding-bottom: 10px;\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  .contributions-list {\\r\\n    list-style: none;\\r\\n    padding: 0;\\r\\n    margin: 0;\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  .contribution {\\r\\n    margin-bottom: 25px;\\r\\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;\\r\\n    padding-bottom: 15px;\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  .contribution:last-child {\\r\\n    border-bottom: none;\\r\\n    margin-bottom: 0;\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  .contribution-title {\\r\\n    font-size: 1.4em;\\r\\n    font-weight: 600;\\r\\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\\r\\n    border-left: 5px solid var(--accent-light-blue);\\r\\n    padding-left: 15px;\\r\\n    display: flex;\\r\\n    align-items: center;\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  .contribution-title svg {\\r\\n    margin-right: 12px;\\r\\n    color: var(--accent-light-blue);\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  .contribution-description {\\r\\n    font-size: 1em;\\r\\n    color: var(--text-medium);\\r\\n    margin: 0;\\r\\n    padding-left: 20px;\\r\\n    line-height: 1.5;\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/style>\\r\\n<\\/head>\\r\\n<body>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n  <\\/div>\\r\\n  \\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n  <ul class=\\\"contributions-list\\\">\\r\\n    <li class=\\\"contribution\\\">\\r\\n      <h2 class=\\\"contribution-title\\\">\\r\\n        <svg xmlns=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.w3.org\\/2000\\/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-server\\\"><rect width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"8\\\" x=\\\"2\\\" y=\\\"2\\\" rx=\\\"2\\\" ry=\\\"2\\\"\\/><rect width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"8\\\" x=\\\"2\\\" y=\\\"14\\\" rx=\\\"2\\\" ry=\\\"2\\\"\\/><line x1=\\\"6\\\" x2=\\\"6\\\" y1=\\\"6\\\" y2=\\\"6\\\"\\/><line x1=\\\"6\\\" x2=\\\"6\\\" y1=\\\"18\\\" y2=\\\"18\\\"\\/><\\/svg>\\r\\n        Configuraci\\u00f3n de Proxmox VE y virtualizaci\\u00f3n\\r\\n      <\\/h2>\\r\\n      <p class=\\\"contribution-description\\\">\\r\\n        Instalaci\\u00f3n y configuraci\\u00f3n del hipervisor, creaci\\u00f3n del pool Zitadel y gesti\\u00f3n de m\\u00e1quinas virtuales y contenedores.\\r\\n      <\\/p>\\r\\n    <\\/li>\\r\\n\\r\\n    <li class=\\\"contribution\\\">\\r\\n      <h2 class=\\\"contribution-title\\\">\\r\\n        <svg xmlns=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.w3.org\\/2000\\/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-shield-check\\\"><path d=\\\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\\\"\\/><path d=\\\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\\\"\\/><\\/svg>\\r\\n        Configuraci\\u00f3n del firewall con OPNsense\\r\\n      <\\/h2>\\r\\n      <p class=\\\"contribution-description\\\">\\r\\n        Definici\\u00f3n de reglas de filtrado, segmentaci\\u00f3n por VLANs y control del tr\\u00e1fico entre zonas de red.\\r\\n      <\\/p>\\r\\n    <\\/li>\\r\\n\\r\\n    <li class=\\\"contribution\\\">\\r\\n      <h2 class=\\\"contribution-title\\\">\\r\\n        <svg xmlns=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.w3.org\\/2000\\/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-network\\\"><rect x=\\\"16\\\" y=\\\"16\\\" width=\\\"6\\\" height=\\\"6\\\" rx=\\\"1\\\"\\/><rect x=\\\"2\\\" y=\\\"16\\\" width=\\\"6\\\" height=\\\"6\\\" rx=\\\"1\\\"\\/><rect x=\\\"9\\\" y=\\\"2\\\" width=\\\"6\\\" height=\\\"6\\\" rx=\\\"1\\\"\\/><path d=\\\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\\\"\\/><path d=\\\"M12 12V8\\\"\\/><\\/svg>\\r\\n        Dise\\u00f1o y configuraci\\u00f3n de VLANs y arquitectura de red\\r\\n      <\\/h2>\\r\\n      <p class=\\\"contribution-description\\\">\\r\\n        Dise\\u00f1o de la segmentaci\\u00f3n de red en cinco zonas y configuraci\\u00f3n del bridge virtual en Proxmox.\\r\\n      <\\/p>\\r\\n    <\\/li>\\r\\n\\r\\n    <li class=\\\"contribution\\\">\\r\\n      <h2 class=\\\"contribution-title\\\">\\r\\n        <svg xmlns=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.w3.org\\/2000\\/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-key-round\\\"><path d=\\\"M2 18v3c0 .6.4 1 1 1h4v-3h3v-3h2l1.4-1.4a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4Z\\\"\\/><circle cx=\\\"16.5\\\" cy=\\\"7.5\\\" r=\\\".5\\\"\\/><\\/svg>\\r\\n        Acceso remoto seguro con WireGuard\\r\\n      <\\/h2>\\r\\n      <p class=\\\"contribution-description\\\">\\r\\n        Implementaci\\u00f3n de una VPN mediante WireGuard en un contenedor LXC para el acceso seguro a la infraestructura.\\r\\n      <\\/p>\\r\\n    <\\/li>\\r\\n\\r\\n    <li class=\\\"contribution\\\">\\r\\n      <h2 class=\\\"contribution-title\\\">\\r\\n        <svg xmlns=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.w3.org\\/2000\\/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-palette\\\"><circle cx=\\\"6\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"3\\\"\\/><path d=\\\"M6 15c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2H6M6 15V9h12v12s-6.1.1-6 6c.1-1.1 1-2 2-2H6\\\"\\/><\\/svg>\\r\\n        Desarrollo del frontend en WordPress\\r\\n      <\\/h2>\\r\\n      <p class=\\\"contribution-description\\\">\\r\\n        Instalaci\\u00f3n del tema, personalizaci\\u00f