(177,1,'2026-01-27 13:13:16','2026-01-27 12:13:16','<style>\n    /* Colores Corporativos Zitadel */\n    :root {\n        --zt-azul: #2061A4; \n        --zt-oscuro: #1A365D; \n        --zt-texto: #4A5568;\n        --zt-borde: #E2E8F0;\n        --zt-fondo: #F8FAFC;\n    }\n    .zt-blog-wrapper {\n        background-color: var(--zt-fondo);\n        padding: 40px 20px;\n        font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    }\n    .zt-blog-section {\n        display: grid;\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));\n        gap: 30px;\n        max-width: 1200px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n    .zt-post-card {\n        background: #ffffff;\n        border-radius: 12px;\n        border: 1px solid var(--zt-borde);\n        overflow: hidden;\n        transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\n    }\n    .zt-post-card:hover {\n        transform: translateY(-8px);\n        box-shadow: 0 12px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n    }\n    .zt-post-img {\n        width: 100%;\n        height: 220px;\n        overflow: hidden;\n        position: relative;\n        background-color: #f0f0f0;\n    }\n    .zt-badge {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 15px;\n        right: 15px;\n        background: var(--zt-azul);\n        color: white;\n        padding: 5px 12px;\n        border-radius: 4px;\n        font-size: 11px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n        z-index: 1;\n    }\n    .zt-post-img img {\n        width: 100%;\n        height: 100%;\n        object-fit: cover;\n    }\n    .zt-post-body {\n        padding: 25px;\n        flex-grow: 1;\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n    }\n    .zt-post-date {\n        font-size: 13px;\n        color: var(--zt-azul);\n        font-weight: 600;\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n    .zt-post-body h2 {\n        margin: 0 0 15px 0;\n        font-size: 19px;\n        color: var(--zt-azul);\n        line-height: 1.3;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        min-height: 50px;\n    }\n    .zt-post-body p {\n        font-size: 14px;\n        color: var(--zt-texto);\n        line-height: 1.6;\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n    .zt-post-btn {\n        background-color: var(--zt-azul);\n        color: white;\n        text-align: center;\n        text-decoration: none;\n        padding: 12px;\n        border-radius: 6px;\n        font-weight: 600;\n        font-size: 13px;\n        transition: background 0.3s;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n        margin-top: auto;\n    }\n    .zt-post-btn:hover {\n        background-color: var(--zt-oscuro);\n    }\n    /* Botón Final */\n    .zt-load-more-container {\n        text-align: center;\n        margin-top: 50px;\n    }\n    .zt-btn-more {\n        background-color: transparent;\n        color: var(--zt-azul);\n        border: 2px solid var(--zt-azul);\n        padding: 15px 40px;\n        border-radius: 8px;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n        text-decoration: none;\n        transition: all 0.3s ease;\n        display: inline-block;\n    }\n    .zt-btn-more:hover {\n        background-color: var(--zt-azul);\n        color: white;\n    }\n</style>\n        <article>\n                Actualidad\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1449034446853-66c86144b0ad?w=600&auto=format\" alt=\"Vigo Cityscape\">\n                27 ENE 2026\n                <h2>Tendencias del mercado en Vigo y alrededores</h2>\n                <p>Analizamos el crecimiento de la demanda de viviendas con eficiencia energética en la zona de Pontevedra.</p>\n                <a href=\"#\">Leer Artículo</a>\n        </article>\n        <article>\n                Guía\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556912177-c54857056a41?w=600&auto=format\" alt=\"Minimalist Interior\">\n        