(222,1,'2026-01-27 13:50:06','2026-01-27 12:50:06','<style>\n    /* Sincronización con el Sistema de Diseño Zitadel */\n    :root {\n        --zt-azul: #2061A4; \n        --zt-oscuro: #1A365D; \n        --zt-texto: #4A5568;\n        --zt-borde: #E2E8F0;\n        --zt-borde-input: #CBD5E0; /* Gris más oscuro para que el borde sea siempre visible */\n        --zt-fondo: #F8FAFC;\n    }\n    .zitadel-contact-wrapper {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-wrap: wrap;\n        gap: 30px;\n        max-width: 1200px;\n        margin: 40px auto;\n        font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n        background-color: var(--zt-fondo);\n        padding: 0 20px;\n    }\n    /* Columnas Estilo Card */\n    .zitadel-contact-col {\n        flex: 1;\n        min-width: 320px;\n        background: #ffffff;\n        padding: 40px;\n        border-radius: 12px;\n        border: 1px solid var(--zt-borde);\n        box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    .zitadel-contact-col h2, .zitadel-contact-col h3 {\n        margin-top: 0;\n        color: var(--zt-azul);\n        font-weight: 700;\n        line-height: 1.3;\n    }\n    .zitadel-contact-col h2 {\n        font-size: 26px;\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n    .zitadel-contact-col h3 {\n        font-size: 20px;\n        margin-bottom: 25px;\n    }\n    .zitadel-intro {\n        font-size: 15px;\n        line-height: 1.6;\n        color: var(--zt-texto);\n        margin-bottom: 30px;\n    }\n    .contact-item {\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n        font-size: 14px;\n        color: var(--zt-texto);\n        line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n    .contact-label {\n        display: block;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        color: var(--zt-oscuro);\n        margin-bottom: 4px;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n        font-size: 12px;\n        letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    }\n    .schedule-box {\n        background-color: #f1f5f9;\n        padding: 25px;\n        border-left: 4px solid var(--zt-azul);\n        border-radius: 8px;\n        margin-top: 30px;\n    }\n    /* Estilos del Formulario con Bordes Visibles */\n    .form-group {\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n    .form-group label {\n        display: block;\n        margin-bottom: 8px;\n        font-weight: 600;\n        font-size: 14px;\n        color: var(--zt-oscuro);\n    }\n    .form-row {\n        display: flex;\n        gap: 20px;\n    }\n    .form-row .form-group {\n        flex: 1;\n    }\n    .zitadel-input {\n        width: 100%;\n        padding: 12px 15px;\n        /* BORDE SIEMPRE VISIBLE: 2px y color más oscuro */\n        border: 2px solid var(--zt-borde-input); \n        border-radius: 8px;\n        font-size: 14px;\n        font-family: inherit;\n        color: var(--zt-texto);\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n        transition: all 0.3s ease;\n        background-color: #fff;\n    }\n    .zitadel-input:focus {\n        border-color: var(--zt-azul); /* Cambia al azul corporativo al hacer click */\n        outline: none;\n        box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(32, 97, 164, 0.1);\n    }\n    /* BOTÓN IDÉNTICO AL BLOG */\n    .zitadel-btn {\n        background-color: var(--zt-azul);\n        color: white;\n        padding: 14px;\n        border: none;\n        border-radius: 6px;\n        width: 100%;\n        font-size: 13px;\n        font-weight: 600;\n        cursor: pointer;\n        transition: background 0.3s ease;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n        letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n    }\n    .zitadel-btn:hover {\n        background-color: var(--zt-oscuro);\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {\n        .form-row {\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 0;\n        }\n    }\n</style>\n        <h2>Contacto</h2>\n        <p>\n            En <b>Zitadel Inmobiliaria</b> estamos listos para asesorarte. Nuestro equipo te atenderá de forma personalizada para encontrar tu hogar ideal o gestionar tu inversión.\n  