40 — Database (10.0.40.0/24)\n            └── VM 204 · MariaDB       10.0.40.204\n    </pre>\n  </section>\n  <section>\n    <h3>Stack tecnológico</h3>\n    <table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th>Categoría</th>\n          <th>Tecnología</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td>Hipervisor</td><td>Proxmox VE</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>IaC — Aprovisionamiento</td><td>Terraform (bpg/proxmox provider)</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>IaC — Configuración</td><td>Ansible</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Firewall / Red</td><td>OPNsense · VLANs 802.1Q</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Web</td><td>WordPress + Apache · Docker Compose</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Base de datos</td><td>MariaDB 10.11</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>SSL</td><td>Let\'s Encrypt</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Monitorización</td><td>Zabbix 7.0</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Acceso remoto</td><td>Tailscale (WireGuard)</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>DNS dinámico</td><td>Dinahosting</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Backup</td><td>Proxmox Backup + estrategia 3-2-1</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </section>\n  <section>\n    <h3>Despliegue</h3>\n    <h4>1. Clonar repositorio</h4>\n    <pre>\ngit clone --recurse-submodules https://github.com/&lt;usuario&gt;/iac-deployment-lab.git\ncd iac-deployment-lab\n    </pre>\n    <h4>2. Configurar Terraform</h4>\n    <pre>\ncd terraform\nexport TF_VAR_pm_password=\"tu_contraseña_proxmox\"\nterraform init\nterraform plan\nterraform apply\n    </pre>\n    <h4>3. Ejecutar playbook de Ansible</h4>\n    <pre>\nansible-playbook -i inventory.ini playbook.yml\n    </pre>\n  </section>\n  <section>\n    <h3>Seguridad</h3>\n    <p>La seguridad se implementa mediante defensa en profundidad: múltiples capas independientes.</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Firewall OPNsense</li>\n      <li>Segmentación VLAN</li>\n      <li>Acceso con Tailscale</li>\n      <li>SSL con Let\'s Encrypt</li>\n      <li>Backups 3-2-1</li>\n    </ul>\n  </section>\n  <section>\n    <h3>Monitorización</h3>\n    <p>Zabbix monitoriza los siguientes hosts y métricas clave:</p>\n    <table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th>Host</th>\n          <th>IP</th>\n          <th>Métricas</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Proxmox</td>\n          <td>192.168.1.220</td>\n          <td>CPU, RAM</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>WordPress</td>\n          <td>10.0.30.204</td>\n          <td>HTTP, rendimiento</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>MariaDB</td>\n          <td>10.0.40.205</td>\n          <td>Queries, conexiones</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n    <p>\n      Alertas configuradas para: disco &gt; 80%, servicios caídos, CPU sostenida &gt; 85% y timeouts HTTP.\n    </p>\n  </section>','Resumen','','inherit','closed','closed','','268-revision-v1','','','2026-04-20 16:29:16','2026-04-20 14:29:16','',268,'https://zitadel.a24iriabc.iesteis.gal/?p=300',0,'revision','',0),
