Press y Docker</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>7. Automatización</td>\n        <td>15 abr – 30 abr</td>\n        <td>2 semanas</td>\n        <td>Ambas</td>\n        <td>Terraform y Ansible</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>8. Seguridad</td>\n        <td>20 abr – 05 may</td>\n        <td>2 semanas</td>\n        <td>Iria</td>\n        <td>Seguridad completa</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>9. Monitorización</td>\n        <td>01 may – 10 may</td>\n        <td>1,5 semanas</td>\n        <td>Ambas</td>\n        <td>Zabbix</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>10. Pruebas</td>\n        <td>10 may – 20 may</td>\n        <td>1,5 semanas</td>\n        <td>Ambas</td>\n        <td>Testing</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>11. Documentación</td>\n        <td>02 mar – 02 jun</td>\n        <td>3 meses (ongoing)</td>\n        <td>Ambas</td>\n        <td>Memoria y blog</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>12. Entrega final</td>\n        <td>03 jun – 05 jun</td>\n        <td>3 días</td>\n        <td>Ambas</td>\n        <td>Entrega</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>							\n																	<img width=\"1024\" height=\"464\" src=\"https://zitadel.a24iriabc.iesteis.gal/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/1777028198327-864f82e2-f684-49e5-b757-55c13b040516_1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://zitadel.a24iriabc.iesteis.gal/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/1777028198327-864f82e2-f684-49e5-b757-55c13b040516_1.png 1024w, https://zitadel.a24iriabc.iesteis.gal/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/1777028198327-864f82e2-f684-49e5-b757-55c13b040516_1-300x136.png 300w, https://zitadel.a24iriabc.iesteis.gal/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/1777028198327-864f82e2-f684-49e5-b757-55c13b040516_1-768x348.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />','Distribución de tareas y Diagrama de Gantt','','inherit','closed','closed','','438-revision-v1','','','2026-04-26 13:04:58','2026-04-26 11:04:58','',438,'https://zitadel.a24iriabc.iesteis.gal/?p=553',